WEBVTT

00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:32.332
Sólheimajökull,
in the south coast of Iceland.

00:00:33.137 --> 00:00:35.167
(Water rushing)

00:00:38.485 --> 00:00:41.321
I wrote a poem for a plaque
that was placed on the mountain

00:00:41.345 --> 00:00:43.206
where Okjökull once stood.

00:00:43.230 --> 00:00:45.078
It was a letter to the future,

00:00:45.102 --> 00:00:46.263
and it says,

00:00:46.287 --> 00:00:49.523
"This monument is to acknowledge
that we know what is happening

00:00:49.547 --> 00:00:51.433
and what needs to be done.

00:00:51.457 --> 00:00:53.477
Only you know if we did it."